1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You can hire somebody to quit your job for you in Japan and I did not understand why until I quit

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,540
my first job here. As soon as I turned in my resignation letter, it was like a criminal trial

3
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:16,600
had started. My boss, my boss's boss, my boss's boss's boss, they sat down and grilled me. They

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:21,400
for real wanted an apology with tears. It was not enough to tell them that I had gotten a better

5
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:26,400
job, they wanted to know all the details. What my new job would be, how long I'd stay there,

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,220
what my salary was gonna be.

7
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,560
And I had heard of people here whose old job

8
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,320
tried to sabotage their new job

9
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,760
with this kind of information, so I was stressed.

10
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,520
And mind you, I come from a country

11
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,280
where I had coworkers who wrote,

12
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:41,000
I quit on a napkin and were never seen again.

13
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:43,220
So yeah, this was quite the culture shock.

14
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,740
After they finally accepted my reason for leaving,

15
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:47,840
they still wanted an apology letter

16
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,820
and for me to give a speech to the staff

17
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,000
saying sorry to them as well.

18
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,260
So it might actually make sense to literally pay someone

19
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,940
to help you quit your job here.

20
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:26,380
Thank you.

